Last name: {{$json.nachname}}
Email: {{$json.email}}
Phone: {{$json.phone}}
Preferred communication language: {{$json.language}}
Desired position: {{$json.position}}
Salary expectation: {{$json.salary}}
Earliest start date: {{$json.start_date}}
Years of professional experience: {{$json.experience_years}}

Self description:
{{$json.description}}
